---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecutionDB as Execution DBs
    participant Objects as Object Storage
    participant Queue as RabbitMQ

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo coordinator once
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load throughput knobs and generate coordinator id
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load database context

    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Call restricted function to claim bounded pending controls
    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Scope claimed work; apply revision or observe worker quiescence
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Scope acknowledgement or retry; match revision and claim
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Restricted function claims up to 16 quiescent revocations with work identity
    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Scope cleanup transactions; settle quiescent revoked runs
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Scope settlement acknowledgement; match revision and token
    Note over Vigilo,ExecutionDB: Controls use direct database calls; unavailable placements remain pending

    loop Bounded ready-plan recovery candidates with accepted identity and execution enabled
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Call restricted admission claim; atomically assign lease and generation
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Claimed work identity, lease and generation, or no work
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Bind claimed identity and read protected plan details
        Vigilo->>Objects: Verify roots, configuration, gate counts and bounded chunk pages
        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Scope each transaction; replay admission and independently verify coverage
        ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Verified placement coverage or candidate failure
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Checkpoint progress; lock placements through restricted function and activate
        Note over Vigilo,ControlDB: Returned failures release ownership and defer the candidate
    end

    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Discover routed execution aliases through restricted function
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Execution database aliases
    loop Serviceable execution placements
        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Discover expired leases through restricted function; retain movement locks
        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Bind exact claimed batch; recheck ownership, recover or fail chunks and settle atomically
        alt Placement operation succeeds
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Recovered chunks and poison chunks failed
        else Placement operation fails
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Database error
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Classify, count, and continue with next alias
        end
    end

    loop Dispatch bounded run-shard windows
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Read dispatch backlog through restricted function
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Claim cursor and bind returned work identity in one statement
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Dispatch route or no work; retain cursor lock
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Prepare run snapshot on the same scoped transaction
        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Bind claimed identity, fence movement and validate admission
        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Upsert run snapshot and insert one chunk-ready outbox record per selected chunk
        alt Execution placement write succeeds
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Dispatch shard window result
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Release or mark dispatch cursor drained
        else Execution placement fails
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Database error
            Note over Vigilo,ControlDB: Cursor stays open
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Classify, count, and exclude alias for this pass
        end
    end

    loop Serviceable databases with bounded concurrency
        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Discover bounded ready candidates through restricted function
        loop Fair page admission within database page and time budgets
            Note over Vigilo,ExecutionDB: Bounded shard concurrency with one in-flight page per shard
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Bind discovered identity with page claim; fence ownership and atomically commit checkpoint
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Ready again, caught up, sealed, busy, or deferred
            opt Busy or invalid page
                Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Rotate candidate in a separate scoped transaction
            end
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Visit unchecked candidates before revisiting remaining ready work
        end
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Await admitted page operations under the database deadline
    end

    loop Finalize bounded terminal runs
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Read finalization backlog through restricted function
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Select candidate through restricted discovery function
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Candidate or no work
        alt Candidate selected
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Read routed shard summaries in one batch per database
            alt Every placement read succeeds and summaries are sealed and valid
                ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Terminal summary rows
                Vigilo->>ControlDB: Claim through restricted lease function; write fenced result and completion event
                ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Finalized run or no update
            else Placement read fails or summary is unsealed or invalid
                ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Partial summaries or database error
                Vigilo->>Vigilo: Defer candidate and continue other runs
            end
        end
    end

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load messaging context
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: List serviceable outbox placements
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Database aliases
    loop Serviceable outbox placements
        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Read backlog and claim payload batch through restricted functions
        alt Placement operation succeeds
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Joined event payload batch
            loop Bounded outbox publish concurrency
                Vigilo->>Vigilo: Acquire messaging circuit admission
                alt Messaging circuit is open
                    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Reschedule delivery row for retry with claim token
                else Circuit is closed or half-open probe
                    Vigilo->>Queue: Publish persistent mandatory event
                    Queue-->>Vigilo: Confirmed publish or returned/nacked publish
                    alt Publish confirmed and claim token current
                        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Mark ledger published and delete delivery row
                    else Publish failed or unroutable
                        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Reschedule delivery row for retry with claim token
                    else Claim token no longer current
                        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Ignore stale publisher result
                    end
                end
            end
        else Placement operation fails
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Database error
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Classify, count, and continue with next alias
        end
    end

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Log cycle totals and placement failure counters
    Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    deactivate Vigilo
